# Base URL of the C# Web API. No trailing slash.
#
# Required for `npm run dev` only. Local dev with `dotnet run` from src/NoteFusion.Api uses
# the port in that project's launchSettings.json, which is NOT 5080 — check the
# "Now listening on" line it prints. `docker compose up` publishes the API on 5080.
#
# This file is for local dev only. Production builds read the committed `.env.production`,
# which points at the deployed API: the dashboard is hosted on its own origin
# (admin.notefusion.studio), not out of the API's wwwroot, so the base URL cannot be empty.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5080
